l1: $ G ⇒ ∃ u ∃ l ∃ e (⟨ o , t ⟩ = ⟨ ⟨ u , ⟨ kc_quot , ⟨ scons l ∅ , e ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ , clam w lvals (sclip {y | ∃ n (n = lv l w ∧ y ∊ clam a (fv uni n) (clam r (cpi i a (cpi j a (fv uni ∅))) (qty a r)))}) ⟩) $ by f214_e_hquot [#1]
l2: $ G , ⟨ o , t ⟩ = ⟨ ⟨ u , ⟨ kc_quot , ⟨ scons l ∅ , e ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ , clam w lvals (sclip {y | ∃ n (n = lv l w ∧ y ∊ clam a (fv uni n) (clam r (cpi i a (cpi j a (fv uni ∅))) (qty a r)))}) ⟩ ⇒ ⟨ o , t ⟩ = ⟨ ⟨ u , ⟨ kc_quot , ⟨ scons l ∅ , e ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ , clam w lvals (sclip {y | ∃ n (n = lv l w ∧ y ∊ clam a (fv uni n) (clam r (cpi i a (cpi j a (fv uni ∅))) (qty a r)))}) ⟩ $ by ax
