l6: $ … ⇒ ∃ u ∃ l ∃ e (⟨ o , t ⟩ = ⟨ ⟨ u , ⟨ kc_lit , ⟨ scons l ∅ , e ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ , clam w lvals (sclip (fv nnf (fv nvf l))) ⟩) $ by ex_intro [l5]
