l13: $ G , x = ⟨ o , t ⟩ , x ∊ hlit ⇒ ∃ u ∃ l ∃ e (⟨ o , t ⟩ = ⟨ ⟨ u , ⟨ kc_lit , ⟨ scons l ∅ , e ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ , clam w lvals (sclip (fv nnf (fv nvf l))) ⟩) $ by ex_elim [l8, l12]
l14: $ G ⇒ ∃ u ∃ l ∃ e (⟨ o , t ⟩ = ⟨ ⟨ u , ⟨ kc_lit , ⟨ scons l ∅ , e ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ , clam w lvals (sclip (fv nnf (fv nvf l))) ⟩) $ by wcel_elim [#1, l13]

