l9: $ … ⇒ ∃ u ∃ a ∃ l ∃ e (x = ⟨ ⟨ u , ⟨ kc_cst , ⟨ scons a (scons l ∅) , e ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ , clam w lvals (sclip (fv Env ⟨ u , ⟨ a , lsv l w ⟩ ⟩)) ⟩) $ by cab_elim [l8]
l10: $ G , x = ⟨ o , t ⟩ , x ∊ hcst , ∃ e (x = ⟨ ⟨ u , ⟨ kc_cst , ⟨ scons a (scons l ∅) , e ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ , clam w lvals (sclip (fv Env ⟨ u , ⟨ a , lsv l w ⟩ ⟩)) ⟩) ⇒ ∃ e (x = ⟨ ⟨ u , ⟨ kc_cst , ⟨ scons a (scons l ∅) , e ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ , clam w lvals (sclip (fv Env ⟨ u , ⟨ a , lsv l w ⟩ ⟩)) ⟩) $ by ax
