l12: $ G , x = ⟨ o , t ⟩ , x ∊ hcst , ∃ l ∃ e (x = ⟨ ⟨ u , ⟨ kc_cst , ⟨ scons a (scons l ∅) , e ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ , clam w lvals (sclip (fv Env ⟨ u , ⟨ a , lsv l w ⟩ ⟩)) ⟩) ⇒ ∃ l ∃ e (x = ⟨ ⟨ u , ⟨ kc_cst , ⟨ scons a (scons l ∅) , e ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ , clam w lvals (sclip (fv Env ⟨ u , ⟨ a , lsv l w ⟩ ⟩)) ⟩) $ by ax
